            {
              "id": "art-body",
              "type": "column",
              "props": {
                "span": 9
              },
              "children": [
                {
                  "id": "lede",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "When your trucks are your livelihood, downtime is more than an inconvenience. It costs money, delays deliveries, and puts pressure on your drivers and customers.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full",
                    "anchor": "post-lede"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-intro-1",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "That's why choosing the right provider for truck parts and service matters more than most fleet owners realize. Whether you operate a few trucks or manage an entire commercial fleet, the dealership and service department you work with should make your life easier, not harder. At Sun State International, we understand what owner-operators and fleet managers expect because we've built our business around supporting hardworking people who rely on their equipment every day.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "h-what-to-look-for",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "What to Look for in a Truck Parts and Service Provider",
                    "headingLevel": 2,
                    "align": "left",
                    "anchor": "what-to-look-for"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-what-to-look-for-1",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Not every dealership delivers the same experience. While many companies can sell parts or schedule repairs, the right commercial fleet service provider offers more than just products. They provide consistency, communication, and dependable support that helps keep your business moving. Here are a few things to prioritize when choosing a truck parts and service partner.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "h3-what-to-look-for-2",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Fast Access to Quality Parts",
                    "headingLevel": 3,
                    "align": "left",
                    "anchor": "fast-parts"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-what-to-look-for-3",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "When a truck is down, waiting several days for a part is rarely an option. A dependable dealership should have access to a large inventory of OEM and aftermarket parts so repairs can happen quickly and correctly. From filters and brakes to suspension components and electrical systems, having the right truck parts in Tampa, FL available quickly helps reduce unnecessary downtime. At Sun State International, our parts departments offer access to a wide range of parts for all makes and models online and in-store.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "co-what-to-look-for-4-row",
                  "type": "row",
                  "props": {
                    "gap": 0
                  },
                  "children": [
                    {
                      "id": "co-what-to-look-for-4",
                      "type": "column",
                      "props": {
                        "span": 12
                      },
                      "styles": {
                        "base": {
                          "borderWidth": 1,
